<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Lists in HTML</title>
</head>
<body>

  <h1>📋 HTML Lists</h1>
  <p>Lists are used to organize information in a clear and simple way.</p>

  <h2>Unordered List: Fruits</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Apple</li>
    <li>Banana</li>
    <li>Mango</li>
    <li>Orange</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Ordered List: Daily Routine</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Wake up</li>
    <li>Brush teeth</li>
    <li>Have breakfast</li>
    <li>Go to school</li>
  </ol>

  <h2>Description List: HTML Tags</h2>
  <dl>
    <dt>HTML</dt>
    <dd>Used to create the structure of a webpage.</dd>

    <dt>CSS</dt>
    <dd>Used to style the webpage.</dd>

    <dt>JavaScript</dt>
    <dd>Used to add interactivity to the webpage.</dd>
  </dl>

</body>
</html>
